# Whenever the chosen Wall is dealt damage by an attacking creature, Glyph of Life triggers once for the damage dealt at once
# (CR 603.2c, 120.2): Benalish Hero (1) and Guerrilla Gorilla (2) attack as a band and Wall of Mist blocks the band, so the Wall
# is dealt 3 in one combat damage event. Bot1 gains 3 life in one trigger, and Blech, Loafing Pest ("whenever you gain life")
# gets one +1/+1 counter, not two (one per attacker).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Benalish Hero
Guerrilla Gorilla
Blech, Loafing Pest
Glyph of Life
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Wall of Mist
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Mist.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Blech, Loafing Pest.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glyph of Life.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Mist)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Benalish Hero > Bot2; Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot2.Block(Wall of Mist > Benalish Hero)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 23
Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Mist.Damage = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Blech, Loafing Pest.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
